# Inno Setup compile output. LWCam.iss and QCPlatform.iss set OutputDir to the
# repository root, where the root .gitignore's *.exe keeps LWCamSetup.exe and
# QCPlatformSetup.exe out of git. These entries guard a build that overrides
# OutputDir back to this folder - the installers are ~100 MB each.
LWCamSetup.exe
QCPlatformSetup.exe
LWSuite.exe
Output/
vendor/postgresql/
